  "fb": "Here's how I build a no-show follow-up in n8n, starting with clinics (salons and studios work the same way): trigger on the status change, send a kind message with the rebook link (no guilt, no fees), wait three days, then check the booking system before any follow-up so nobody gets chased after they've already rebooked.\n\nSwipe for the four decisions. Want my free enquiry workflow? Message me FLOW.",
  "ig": "No-show follow-up, the way I build it in n8n.\n\nMy poll last week was quiet, so I picked the one that costs appointment businesses the most empty slots: clinics first, but salons, studios and repair shops have the same problem.\n\n1. Trigger on the booking status changing to no_show (a webhook, not a daily sweep)\n2. Send a kind message with the rebook link. No guilt, no fees.\n3. Wait 3 days\n4. Check the booking system. Already rebooked? Stop. Otherwise, one gentle follow-up.\n\nStep 4 is the one most builds skip, and it's the one that stops patients getting nagged.\n\nWant the free enquiry workflow to start with? DM me FLOW.\n\n#n8n #automation #healthcare #freelancer #nocode #workflow",
